  "richContent": "<p>红利全红了</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>这一波，大体回撤-15%~-16%，在红利相关指数回撤历史上，幅度中等偏大一些些。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>其中买在这波凹坑尖底的南方红利低波50收益率已经9.5%，这一波中回撤相对是最低的-12%，四个非常相关相似也时不时不一样，错开也能有些超额收益吧</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>致☞：</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>https://qieman.com/content/content-detail?postId=82573</p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/8AA7FA70-4F2A-4EEE-98FE-090582E9F292.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/6A8E62B8-FF40-4211-95BE-1B5455814208.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/B0B2172C-F16B-43B4-B164-1C45CC2A499D.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/571D1B17-9A65-4696-B694-AD696EF57525.png\" />\n<img src=\"https://cdn-community.qieman.com/7AF7F514-DD35-44EC-938D-8D9E5A5C05C2.png\" />",
